\pard\qc\sa100\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw8\brdrcf1\n{\pict\dibitmap0\picw96\pich96\picwgoal960\pichgoal960

}\par\n\pard\ql\sa60{\f0\fs28\b PPT RUNNER \u8212? PRIVACY NOTICE\b0}\par\n\pard\ql\sa180{\f0\fs18\cf3 PPT Runner  \u183?  Effective Date: 7 October 2026}\par\n\pard\sa180\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 1. Overview\b0\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 PPT Runner is designed to operate with minimal data collection. The project does not require a user account for its basic operation.\par\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 2. Information Used During a Session\b0\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 During a connection, PPT Runner may process temporary technical information required to establish and operate the remote-control session, including:\par\n\pard\li360\fi-180\sa70\f0\fs18 \u8226? A temporary session ID.\par\n\pard\li360\fi-180\sa70\f0\fs18 \u8226? Local and relay WebSocket connection addresses.\par\n\pard\li360\fi-180\sa70\f0\fs18 \u8226? Connection and transport state.\par\n\pard\li360\fi-180\sa70\f0\fs18 \u8226? Presentation-control commands such as Next and Previous.\par\n\pard\li360\fi-180\sa70\f0\fs18 \u8226? Technical network information required for communication.\par\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 3. Presentation Content\b0\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 PPT Runner does not need to read, upload, or store the contents of your PowerPoint presentations in order to perform its remote-control function.\par\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 4. Accounts and Tracking\b0\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 PPT Runner does not require a user account for its basic operation. The project does not intentionally use advertising or behavioural tracking mechanisms as part of the application.\par\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 5. Data Sharing\b0\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 PPT Runner does not sell personal information. When relay connectivity is used, technical connection information and remote-control messages may pass through the third-party relay infrastructure required to connect the mobile device and desktop application.\par\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 6. Retention\b0\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 Session information is intended to be temporary. The MVP does not use a persistent database for user accounts, presentation content, or session history.\par\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 7. Security\b0\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 When the cloud relay is used, PPT Runner uses secure WebSocket communication (WSS). Local connections use the local network connection required for direct communication between the phone and Windows desktop.\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 No method of transmission or storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure, and users should consider the security of the network and devices on which they use the application.\par\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 8. Changes to This Privacy Notice\b0\par\n\pard\sa100\f0\fs18 This Privacy Notice may be updated as PPT Runner evolves. Updated versions may be distributed with future releases.\par\n\pard\sa90\f0\fs22\b 9. Contact\b0\par\n\pard\sa70\f0\fs18 Project: PPT Runner\par\n\pard\sa70\f0\fs18 Developer: Hemant Verma\par\n\pard\ql\sa90{\f0\fs18\b LinkedIn:\b0 } https://www.linkedin.com/in/hemant-verma-ind/\par\n\pard\sa140\par\n\pard\qc\sa60\n{\pict\dibitmap0\picw96\pich64\picwgoal360\pichgoal240

}\par\n{\f0\fs18\b \u2349?\u2366?\u2352?\u2340? \u2350?\u2375?\u2306? \u2344?\u2367?\u2352?\u2381?\u2350?\u2367?\u2340?\b0}\par\n{\f0\fs18 Made in India}\par\n\pard\sa90\n\pard\sb140\sa100\brdrt\brdrs\brdrw8\brdrcf4\n{\f0\fs16\cf3 This document describes the project\u8217?s intended data practices and does not constitute legal advice, legal certification, court approval, or government endorsement.}\par\n\pard\qc\f0\fs16\cf3 \u169? 2026 PPT Runner\par}